---
import OptimizedImage from '../../../components/ui/OptimizedImage.astro';
---
<section
  class="vn-podbor-expert"
  data-review-id="podbor-expert"
  data-review-title="Подбор: эксперт и видеоподбор"
  data-review-path="src/components/leadgen/sections/04-Trust.astro"
>
  <div class="vn-container">
    <div class="vn-grid-12 vn-podbor-expert__layout">
      <div class="vn-podbor-expert__visual" style="grid-column: 1 / 6">
        <div class="vn-podbor-expert__media">
          <OptimizedImage
            src="/images/mikhail-desk.png"
            alt="Михаил Хряпин, эксперт по военной ипотеке в Краснодаре"
            width={1170}
            height={1438}
            loading="lazy"
            class="vn-podbor-expert__photo"
          />
          <div class="vn-podbor-expert__badge">
            <span>65</span>
            <p>сделок по военной ипотеке</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-podbor-expert__quote">
          <p>
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">“Важно выбрать не просто квартиру под сумму, а объект, который проходит по документам, району, срокам и ликвидности. Тогда покупка становится понятным решением, а не случайным выбором.”</span>
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">“Смотрим не только цену, но и документы, район, сроки и ликвидность объекта.”</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="vn-podbor-expert__content" style="grid-column: 7 / 13">
        <span class="vn-label-mono vn-podbor-expert__label">После заявки</span>
        <h2 class="vn-podbor-expert__title">
          <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Расскажу, какой ЖК подходит под ваш запрос</span>
          <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Расскажу, какой ЖК подходит под ваш запрос</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="vn-podbor-expert__lead">
          <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Какие актуальные акции есть у застройщика и на что обратить внимание.</span>
          <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Какие акции есть у застройщика и на что обратить внимание.</span>
        </p>

        <div class="vn-podbor-expert__video-head">
          <span>Видеоподбор</span>
          <p>Что будет внутри</p>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-podbor-expert__facts" aria-label="Что будет в видеоподборе">
          <article class="vn-podbor-expert__fact">
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__num">01</span>
            <div>
              <h3>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Лучшие ЖК</span>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Лучшие ЖК</span>
              </h3>
              <p>Район, цена, сроки.</p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="vn-podbor-expert__fact">
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__num">02</span>
            <div>
              <h3>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Скидки и акции</span>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Скидки и акции</span>
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Выбор предложений.</span>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Выбор предложений.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="vn-podbor-expert__fact">
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__num">03</span>
            <div>
              <h3>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">На что обратить внимание</span>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">На что обратить внимание</span>
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Преимущества и недостатки ЖК.</span>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Преимущества и недостатки ЖК.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="vn-podbor-expert__fact">
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__num">04</span>
            <div>
              <h3>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Следующий шаг</span>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Следующий шаг</span>
              </h3>
              <p>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Ипотека и сопровождение.</span>
                <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Ипотека и сопровождение.</span>
              </p>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="vn-podbor-expert__actions">
          <a
            href="/contacts/#request"
            class="vn-btn-primary vn-podbor-expert__cta"
            data-modal-open
            data-modal-title="Напишите ваше имя и телефон"
            data-modal-subtitle="Уточню ваш запрос и задачу, а затем подготовлю подборку квартир."
            data-modal-source="/podbor/expert"
          >
            Получить подборку квартир
          </a>
          <p>
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text">Уточняю запрос и подготавливаю варианты.</span>
            <span class="vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text">Уточняю запрос и подготавливаю варианты.</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .vn-podbor-expert {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 104px 0 112px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, var(--color-bg-secondary) 0%, var(--color-bg-primary) 100%);
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(90deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-secondary) 88%, transparent) 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-primary) 76%, transparent) 48%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-primary) 92%, transparent) 100%),
      url('/images/krasnodar-newbuild-hero.png');
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
    opacity: 0.16;
    filter: saturate(0.72) contrast(0.92);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(180deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-secondary) 82%, transparent) 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-primary) 94%, transparent) 100%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__layout {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__visual {
    min-width: 0;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text {
    display: none;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__media {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    min-height: 640px;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 18px;
    background: var(--color-bg-dark);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-xl);
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__media::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent 56%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-dark) 58%, transparent) 100%),
      linear-gradient(135deg, color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-primary) 16%, transparent), transparent 52%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__photo {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    min-height: 640px;
    display: block;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: 44% center;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__badge {
    position: absolute;
    left: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    bottom: 24px;
    z-index: 1;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 14px;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 16px 18px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-text-ondark) 16%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-bg-dark) 76%, transparent);
    backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__badge span {
    color: var(--color-text-ondark);
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__badge p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-ondark-mute);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__label {
    color: var(--color-accent-cta);
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__title {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 18px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.12;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__lead {
    max-width: 650px;
    margin: 22px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--fs-lead);
    line-height: 1.65;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__quote {
    margin-top: 18px;
    padding: 20px 0 0 20px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent-cta);
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__quote p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__video-head {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-top: 28px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 18px;
    padding: 0 0 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__video-head span {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 32px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-cta) 24%, transparent);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--color-accent-cta) 8%, transparent);
    color: var(--color-accent-cta);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__video-head p {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__facts {
    max-width: 680px;
    display: grid;
    margin-top: 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__fact {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 56px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    padding: 20px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    transform: translateY(10px);
    opacity: 0;
    animation: vn-podbor-expert-in 520ms ease forwards;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__fact:nth-child(2) {
    animation-delay: 90ms;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__fact:nth-child(3) {
    animation-delay: 180ms;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__fact:nth-child(4) {
    animation-delay: 270ms;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__num {
    color: var(--color-accent-cta);
    font-size: var(--fs-caption);
    font-weight: 650;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__fact h3 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-primary);
    font-size: var(--fs-h3);
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.24;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__fact p {
    max-width: 560px;
    margin: 8px 0 0;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    font-size: var(--fs-body);
    line-height: 1.55;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 32px;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__actions p {
    max-width: 330px;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text-tertiary);
    font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  .vn-podbor-expert__cta {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  @keyframes vn-podbor-expert-in {
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .vn-podbor-expert__fact {
      animation: none;
      opacity: 1;
      transform: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1120px) {
    .vn-podbor-expert__media {
      min-height: 560px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__photo {
      min-height: 560px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    .vn-podbor-expert__visual,
    .vn-podbor-expert__content {
      grid-column: 1 / -1 !important;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__visual {
      width: min(100%, 560px);
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__media {
      min-height: 620px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__photo {
      min-height: 620px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__content {
      margin-top: 44px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .vn-podbor-expert {
      padding: 58px 0 68px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__desktop-text {
      display: none;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__mobile-text {
      display: inline;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__content {
      order: 1;
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__visual {
      order: 2;
      margin-top: 34px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__media {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 430px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__photo {
      min-height: 430px;
      object-position: 42% center;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__badge {
      left: 16px;
      right: 16px;
      bottom: 16px;
      padding: 14px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__badge span {
      font-size: var(--fs-h2);
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__title {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: var(--fs-h2);
      line-height: 1.14;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__lead {
      margin-top: 14px;
      font-size: var(--fs-body);
      line-height: 1.58;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__quote {
      padding: 16px 0 0 18px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__quote p {
      font-size: var(--fs-body);
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__video-head {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 24px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__fact {
      grid-template-columns: 40px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
      padding: 17px 0;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__fact h3 {
      font-size: var(--fs-body);
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__fact p {
      margin-top: 5px;
      font-size: var(--fs-body-sm);
      line-height: 1.45;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__actions {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 26px;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__cta {
      width: 100%;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .vn-podbor-expert__actions p {
      max-width: none;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
